From b32682e1dd4f41b72c9f6ec34cd6ca9c7f9bdc2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rene Dudfield <renedudfield@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 22:55:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] frontend: plugins: Support a default app theme

Allow a plugin to select its registered theme when the user has no saved theme
preference. Registration and selection update Redux together, so the first
render does not remain on the operating system theme.
